    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "而一直替这间空房交房租的，是她的丈夫高羽悟。",
      "sha256": "9ecf0af87c3b63200f07bb7496acc291406ca12b2beb0a8f72b718c8c8f7a191",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
