      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.088,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.912
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "玄关的血迹是B型，鞋印二十四厘米，都不是奈美子的。",
      "sha256": "a8cb6d62f38dd13233a676409d9d1fecb5bf8d0fe2d1542405cb91c129187df7",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（主创 2026-11-24 试听改选；本会话注册），克制压抑，实测约 4 字/秒",
