      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.904,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.096
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "沿着血迹，警员在洗手池和附近公园找到冲洗的痕迹。",
      "sha256": "be1e583ee8cabac597ad7225dc76a8158d7c1c883c8705b9978f6183a5d13eaa",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（主创 2026-11-24 试听改选；本会话注册），克制压抑，实测约 4 字/秒",
