      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.496,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.504
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "所以他们推断，凶手在打斗里受了伤，却还是逃掉了。",
      "sha256": "7dd95da6604b1a00fb04fdfacf513d58120732912969236cdf9d280243a067f4",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（主创 2026-11-24 试听改选；本会话注册），克制压抑，实测约 4 字/秒",
