      "target_start": 48,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.088,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.912
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "案发几年后，到访现场的专家指出：这摊血不是她的。",
      "sha256": "66276d0644a6b7f6dc24f0ceb595ce351761b9aeb9682e108ede34cbe0d3a174",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（主创 2026-11-24 试听改选；本会话注册），克制压抑，实测约 4 字/秒",
      "narration_id": "S10",
      "target_start": 54,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.768,
      "atempo": 1.128,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "高羽悟这才明白，凶手把自己的血留在了玄关。",
      "sha256": "505e298c459d413f7a7b37e9f8970dc65a0ae45fad9d7c1f3289877a0ff5da36",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（主创 2026-11-24 试听改选；本会话注册），克制压抑，实测约 4 字/秒",
