      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.528,
      "atempo": 1.088,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "搬走以后，他每月照付房租，只为把现场原样留住。",
