      "source_duration": 4.464,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.536
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "第二天，现场血迹的DNA比对一致，她被以杀人嫌疑逮捕。",
