      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.808,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.192
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "消息传开时，高羽悟等这一刻，已经整整二十六年。",
